sm_tufnlMykQ7kNvwEZjGQT&_nc_oc=AdpNwJKZjsOrIUIapp_0A_XFBM9nVANjFE2XbR_shmIOzrjk4cWn9Yl2JlLpZFBuXjQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3I3FE2d4cW0vSa5J3IOjYUU7AaBc-HTdgc8fRJZyx2IA&oe=69DE4BB7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6GD9M3yF-I0Q7kNvwHegbUl&_nc_oc=AdoGTHruClvwu3qPU_I-47KhVSCNPmaODMI3tkGHoUVoKmZv9Eq0H5rglWnJi4y_M8A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0BMCbaWFtgRf5VWcCD0yGkvzRTwLQY0HUrWJMR6o0xkg&oe=69DE4D4A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qEu7XCGEuckQ7kNvwFoaWEq&_nc_oc=AdqhvAPPjBMskZ7dwC-hcwuQXKixNO05c5jxzOOFD-h_yDVoONaM3KnqbJo4YBQcdyg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1R33-ePd7J-lu7NiVx-SiKgy_hxQuFV6yHgh6cwrj5nw&oe=69DE3A6F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ehisj_kBf6AQ7kNvwHkBPG_&_nc_oc=AdrBsPpxqU4ICTlMocGgf4GjAvUvYL5rgQCIMoPcEN7O4XSFYQmKXum4jA2Zz5ueGBc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af29KRZGPx_sUVZjQJ6hS0MVZiOE4qKWOjpNcLnPnwgvkg&oe=69DE23C3"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=r7rrJ9WP80MQ7kNvwFktfQO&_nc_oc=Adr_zuIgCdsgXb-FPlZ0XOanbxbtaldjdjf7w3HCp15DfzEzQg2BNCFZJLaTirR8ZzE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1k-NOKGEYdVxg1bgABngkl4IS5RXiNCSlQdoQf7it9Fw&oe=69DE5458"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KF92eToKxC8Q7kNvwF6XQ8L&_nc_oc=AdrPge3C11yVQmHwVkwyVq0oA8Qd6ybwYpz1_brDfBC4zbfUxv8eYm3O4hOXcyvxTNs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1Tm7vhQGK5C-XsSTKxf0JDqK4xWT14xpenb_jgjEdYHQ&oe=69DE2F3C"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080